# Stable spec ID: punch-gold-rush. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(bourbon @ ~Elijah Craig Kentucky Straight Bourbon) 2 oz
(lemon: juice, fresh) 3/4 oz
(honey syrup, 3:1 honey to water) 3/4 oz

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(rocks glass)

::instructions
<shake, measured ingredients with ice in (cocktail shaker)>
<strain, into a chilled (rocks glass, with one large ice cube)>

::notes
This records one source-specific version; no universal formula or automatic product substitution is implied.
OSF accepts a close bourbon equivalent to the source-preferred bottle. Prepare the honey syrup at the stated 3:1 honey-to-water ratio; the source does not specify mass or volume.

